{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1000_null", "source_sha256": "5dd14484d830bf0e4ec5932f23f035237828f1ecca25a8d7b7ca76c39bbfe213", "ja": "ライブイベントの宣伝のため\n生放送のテレビ番組に告知出演中……", "zh": "为宣传演唱会活动\n正在直播的电视节目中进行宣传出演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1001_mc2", "source_sha256": "6e634cb647758cb5a0dde2b545a8791e082562c9ba85e05eacee3bfaf4937680", "ja": "新人アイドル盛りだくさんのライブ、楽しみですね～。\nでは、そんな新人アイドルのひとり……。", "zh": "新人偶像云集的演唱会，真令人期待呀～。\n那么，接下来介绍其中一位新人偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1002_mc2", "source_sha256": "88a80f39630bda6edf7e2758df07fe2b6d0e7fb08e27902e1eb53420572e0929", "ja": "MILLIONSTARS Team7thの\nジュリアさんからのメッセージです！　どうぞ～！", "zh": "这是一条来自MILLIONSTARS Team7th\n茱莉亚的留言！请看～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "d2223a3605c928aac75527400da9dfc116a09c3c2e285ccdcce996155fec9d70", "ja": "あ。えっと……ど、どうも、ジュリア……です。\nあ、いや。その……。あ～っ！", "zh": "啊。那个……你、你好，我是茱莉亚……。\n啊，不。那个……啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "c6b84b7e31b943ae5358a677aae32eeae23914b910efadcf5e309c6b1dd8e557", "ja": "とにかく、メッセージはライブステージで伝える！\n絶対後悔させない。約束するから、来てくれよな！", "zh": "总之，我要在现场舞台上把心意传达给你！\n绝对不会让你后悔的。我保证，所以一定要来啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1005_se", "source_sha256": "028462f1dfdd9d24259ded91cbe4a60e605838a01af2295e7ad5a8594ce60544", "ja": "パチパチパチパチ……！", "zh": "（掌声如雷）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1006_401pro", "source_sha256": "83c4245f2086c23f284fef94342f099813505a3673d22dee09a1064583929485", "ja": "お疲れさま、ジュリア！\nイベントの宣伝、バッチリだったぞ！", "zh": "辛苦了，茱莉亚！\n活动宣传做得非常到位！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "d05809cafec87920513aa488d2639f3b91b860a49132b16e21622039c18d1e73", "ja": "いやダメだろ！？　くぅ……！\nあー、悪い。生放送はさすがにテンパった。", "zh": "哪有啊！？咕……！\n啊——抱歉。直播果然还是让我慌了手脚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "e1daaf06b261a2194504333d9acce1d9441a6dd14fe57d1fe5cdcaf564a94f9e", "ja": "他のチーム、けっこうテレビに出てたよな。サヨ達は\n生放送だっけ。……神経が鉄でできてるのか？", "zh": "其他队伍都挺常上电视的嘛。纱代她们是直播来着？……神经是铁打的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "0c2846e7ff7c3a00e7129a3bbfb09a8df2ab729b7c18b2d72ba83c7f1c9bba5c", "ja": "いや、テンパったのも含めて、パンチがあったよ。\nみんなの印象にしっかり残せたと思う！", "zh": "不，连慌了手脚在内，效果还是很有冲击力的。\n我觉得肯定给大家留下了深刻印象！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "9ee6ec0c69b5c62eaf6905ff187f8e2939a2e78a21d5ab3fc2c22e917e84f159", "ja": "はぁ……だったらいいけどな。\nつか、なんであたしが代表で出演なんだ？", "zh": "唉……要是那样就好了。\n话说，为什么偏偏是我代表出演啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "35600acd4f4e3752e3d30b4a9b2700a86eb09f96603f6afdaf420029441391b3", "ja": "それはもちろん、\nTeam7thのリーダーはジュリアだからな。", "zh": "那当然是因为，Team7th的队长是茱莉亚啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "5a3d6beaa05c4b287a5924b8b102bd1d4c42f3c588440d0e219c7552a38b2ed8", "ja": "いや、そもそも、それがなんでだよ？\nレイでも歩でも、逆に可奈でもよかっただろ？", "zh": "不是，话说回来，为什么会是这样啊？\n换成丽花、步，甚至可奈不也可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1013_401pro", "source_sha256": "a65145275d6bda6caca9c852834c55016197c5200f43c7d8a18c62e4d87ed18e", "ja": "うーん、確かに今回の宣伝に関しては、他のメンバー\nでも良かったかもしれないな。", "zh": "嗯……确实，这次的宣传，换成其他成员也许也可以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "4186d00be7adaaccb38d2f241c7ee56c527ce62e559aed66cba341d0b2bda327", "ja": "だろ？　歩のダンスは絶対に目を引くし、\n可奈の歌にピンと来るやつも少なくないはずだ。", "zh": "对吧？步的舞蹈绝对很吸引眼球，能被可奈的歌打动的人应该也不在少数。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "df93fcf6d83506faab4f31b22eba04db66f46e156bdb968a52c8ba69c7ae37af", "ja": "レイは……何しでかすか想像もつかないけど、\n爪痕を残すって意味ではぶっちぎりだろうな……。", "zh": "丽花她……真不知道会搞出什么名堂，不过要说留下深刻印象，她肯定是最出色的吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1016_401pro", "source_sha256": "60ca36b1595858c90321687971d34d18f5f41bdd916c2e5c6dc7287f7a1b24ae", "ja": "リーダーも、他の子に任せたら任せたで、できるとは\n思う。……でも、やっぱりジュリアがいいかな。", "zh": "我觉得把领队交给其他人，也不是做不到。……但是，果然还是茱莉亚比较好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "48b801d2e46443d3141f67ebf525f2e294fc7563055c5d9c0887715732d0ce65", "ja": "だから、なんで。", "zh": "所以，为什么啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1018_401pro", "source_sha256": "d4d3072b25226ef43a63974330a77cb5f4325c27350215612b6ddcf69234a453", "ja": "ほら、ジュリアって、\n意外とツッコミ役だから。", "zh": "你看，茱莉亚其实意外地很会吐槽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "80259469a7620f5363377a45978ccff67aa55fc5a007246ae61b8faaa42d4d34", "ja": "…………。は？", "zh": "…………。哈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "5c91192ccfe09a0d1915faeac1e27229406eb9855ab248ab320c0b259cf56a04", "ja": "あ・ん・た・なぁ～～！！\n人をおちょくってんのか！？", "zh": "你、你这家伙啊～～！！\n你是在耍我吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "4b22c28354e5eb9558491807c262c794c94e6e8d316e103749d0cfbbf38164ef", "ja": "い、いや、真面目に言ってるんだって！\nツッコミ役ってことはつまり……！", "zh": "不、不是，我是认真的啊！\n所谓吐槽役，也就是说……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1022_401pro", "source_sha256": "69a4647ff1c970eb7f46c5cff3560a9b0fbc0a4d1c7973646b969f2cb2dc8cde", "ja": "周りが見えてるってことだと思うんだ。\nだから、バランスも取れるし。", "zh": "我觉得这说明你能看清周围的情况。\n所以也能很好地掌握平衡。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "43ac20068226edf08cf22ab36604d12a6f844c4066bb141faa191a9ae429be95", "ja": "……。バランス……？", "zh": "……。平衡……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1024_401pro", "source_sha256": "307d063e8eced31e85c173be082e8fcfe964773af6b580886f6a50bfc358fa8c", "ja": "さっきも他の子ならどんな告知になるか言ってただろ？\nメンバーの特徴をちゃんと理解してるってことだ。", "zh": "你刚才不是也说了，如果换成其他孩子，会做成什么样的宣传吗？\n这就说明你确实充分理解了成员们各自的特点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1025_401pro", "source_sha256": "584c0e17e5aef93d0ab525de0de585c97cd02d614c1168bfa3a5c9b5e56503ce", "ja": "みんなの個性も周りの空気も読めて、状況も見えてる。\nうん、やっぱり、ジュリアでよかったと思うな。", "zh": "既能看懂大家的个性，也能顾及周围的氛围，还能看清当下的状况。\n嗯，我果然还是觉得，选茱莉亚真是太对了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "1bc130ba480de14975eaa7d3a7d0a3ecab864f6bf0ed1943c06b03886303a7d6", "ja": "……。まぁ、あんたと、他のメンバーがいいなら、\n別にいいんだけどさ……、ん？", "zh": "……。嘛，要是你和其他成员都没意见的话，\n我倒是无所谓啦……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1027_se", "source_sha256": "520f7476d0ff27f255d954fa05ad6b93f090a76054d08e9192cfad2663a2e51a", "ja": "ブーッ、ブーッ……。", "zh": "嘟——嘟——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "0bef12dc9cc334a53d5343ab2b079265ca2d79e38a071a1a58df14a5aa078969", "ja": "携帯にメッセージが……ああ、レイ達か。\n噂をすれば……うん？", "zh": "手机上收到消息了……啊，是丽花她们啊。\n说曹操曹操到……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1029_401pro", "source_sha256": "e420a3d6ae04f5a44351736968c1f428e500f7f4f53b857f18870dce82ff0492", "ja": "どれどれ？「告知面白かったよ、お疲れさま！\nさすが私たちのリーダーだね♪」", "zh": "我看看？“告知很有意思哦，辛苦啦！\n不愧是我们的队长♪”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1030_401pro", "source_sha256": "5458a050bd8c5f55000633f086fce880e22470b163e17c61cdbf92556c50d036", "ja": "「ロックな告知じゃん！\nうちのリーダーにしかできないよね～」", "zh": "“宣传得好摇滚啊！\n也就只有我们队长才能做到了～”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1031_401pro", "source_sha256": "5b12c13c9bb8c9a6e9e5dfa7de8ed5980e1f106bd4ef198174c145a02815d2c0", "ja": "「告知ロックロック～♪　心わっくわっく～♪\nジュリアさんがリーダーでよかったです！」……と。", "zh": "「公告摇滚摇滚～♪　心情兴奋雀跃～♪\n由茱莉亚来当队长真是太好了！」……这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0473_1032_050jul", "source_sha256": "c6e09d765b3354432b1705449cc322602775f8bbe250cff263616470c1fc20d1", "ja": "……。なんだよ、みんなして、\n人に押し付けやがって……。ばーか。", "zh": "……真是的，全都\n硬推给我……大笨蛋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
